WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.172
Mandy sat on a step in front of the Parthenon.

2
00:00:09.173 --> 00:00:12.612
Socrates’ students gathered around.

3
00:00:12.613 --> 00:00:16.463
Mandy listened as Socrates spoke.

4
00:00:16.464 --> 00:00:20.533
He was glad Mandy was sitting with them.

5
00:00:20.534 --> 00:00:25.954
Socrates was saying that girls should go to school, just like boys.

6
00:00:25.955 --> 00:00:30.342
Suddenly Mandy remembered the photo in her pocket.

7
00:00:30.343 --> 00:00:32.224
She took it out.

8
00:00:32.225 --> 00:00:38.093
"It’s changed colors!" she said a bit too loudly.

9
00:00:38.094 --> 00:00:43.108
In the picture, the helmet on the statue was glowing blue.

10
00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:47.329
"What is that?" said a man sitting next to Mandy.

11
00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:49.881
He was pointing at the photo.

12
00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:54.290
"Nothing," she said nervously.

13
00:00:54.291 --> 00:00:58.945
The students gathered around to look at the strange picture.

14
00:00:58.946 --> 00:01:02.266
One of the students held out his hand.

15
00:01:02.267 --> 00:01:04.809
"Give me that," he said.

16
00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:08.292
"No, I won’t," Mandy replied.

17
00:01:08.293 --> 00:01:11.673
"I can’t get home without it."

18
00:01:11.674 --> 00:01:14.672
The student tried to grab the photo.

19
00:01:14.673 --> 00:01:16.672
Mandy stood up.

20
00:01:16.673 --> 00:01:19.268
She tried to hide the photo.

21
00:01:19.269 --> 00:01:23.698
But more students noticed the glowing helmet.

22
00:01:23.699 --> 00:01:26.971
"Gods above!" someone said.

23
00:01:26.972 --> 00:01:29.206
People started shouting.

24
00:01:29.207 --> 00:01:32.064
Their eyes grew wide with fear.

25
00:01:32.065 --> 00:01:36.884
Because of the fuss, Socrates came over to Mandy.

26
00:01:36.885 --> 00:01:40.288
"Who are you?" he asked.

27
00:01:40.289 --> 00:01:42.815
Mandy did not answer.

28
00:01:42.816 --> 00:01:49.102
She turned and ran up the rest of the steps into the Parthenon.

29
00:01:49.103 --> 00:01:53.989
Back at the gymnasium, Vinnie was thinking about Mandy.

30
00:01:53.990 --> 00:01:59.008
"Jason," he said, "I think I should find my sister.

31
00:01:59.009 --> 00:02:01.868
She’s probably wondering where I am."

32
00:02:01.869 --> 00:02:08.920
"Sister?" the other boys laughed loudly.

33
00:02:08.921 --> 00:02:11.339
"Isn’t she at home cooking?"

34
00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:16.019
The boys started teasing Vinnie, but Jason did not.

35
00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:21.342
"Do not say such things about our sisters!" Jason yelled.

36
00:02:21.343 --> 00:02:24.733
He and Vinnie walked out of the gymnasium.

37
00:02:24.734 --> 00:02:28.541
"You are close to your sister," he said to Vinnie.

38
00:02:28.542 --> 00:02:31.271
"Like me and Callia."

39
00:02:31.272 --> 00:02:35.487
"Yes, I’m worried about her," said Vinnie.

40
00:02:35.488 --> 00:02:40.598
"Maybe Mandy went back to my house," Jason replied.

41
00:02:40.599 --> 00:02:43.493
The boys ran back to Jason’s house.

42
00:02:43.494 --> 00:02:46.868
Callia was in her room, weaving.

43
00:02:46.869 --> 00:02:52.203
"Callia, is Mandy here?" Jason asked.

44
00:02:52.204 --> 00:02:54.472
Callia shook her head.

45
00:02:54.473 --> 00:02:58.405
"Weren’t you going to the Parthenon?" she asked.

46
00:02:58.406 --> 00:03:04.154
"That’s right! Mandy must be there!" Vinnie shouted.

47
00:03:04.155 --> 00:03:07.878
Waving good-bye, the boys ran out of the house.

48
00:03:07.879 --> 00:03:10.632
They ran through the agora.

49
00:03:10.633 --> 00:03:15.109
They climbed the steps to the Acropolis.

50
00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:21.107
"Jason!" gasped Vinnie. "Wait for me!"

51
00:03:21.108 --> 00:03:24.157
Jason really was a fast runner.

52
00:03:24.158 --> 00:03:27.219
Vinnie could hardly keep up.

53
00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:32.554
"Sorry, Vinnie," grinned Jason. "I’ll slow down."

54
00:03:32.555 --> 00:03:37.431
The boys made it to the top of the hill.

55
00:03:37.432 --> 00:03:40.629
Vinnie took a deep breath and looked down.

56
00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:44.679
The view was amazing.

57
00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:49.472
"You can see all of Athens from here," Vinnie remarked.

58
00:03:49.473 --> 00:03:51.802
Jason nodded proudly.

59
00:03:51.803 --> 00:03:55.153
"Yes, it truly is a beautiful city.

60
00:03:55.154 --> 00:04:01.656
Come, Vinnie, let’s find Mandy."

